Thu Sep 10 17:45:32 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- New package: tilth 0.10.1, a tree-sitter based code indexer that
  answers structural queries (definitions, references, callers, file
  outlines) from the CLI or as an MCP server instead of dumping whole
  files:
  * vendored crates are updated off upstream's Cargo.lock
    (cargo_vendor update=true), so the shipped binary is not built
    from the exact dependency set upstream tested
  * License: covers the statically linked non-MIT crates -
    Apache-2.0 (tree-sitter-elixir), BSD-3-Clause (encoding_rs),
    Zlib (foldhash)
  * requires git-core at runtime: "tilth diff" and the file overview
    shell out to git

